  "title": "MSCCLang: Microsoft Collective Communication Language",
  "abstract": "Machine learning models with millions or billions of parameters are increasingly trained and served on large multi-GPU systems. As models grow in size and execute on more GPUs, collective communication becomes a bottleneck. Custom collective algorithms optimized for both particular network topologies and application-specific communication patterns can alleviate this bottleneck and help these applications scale. However, implementing correct and efficient custom algorithms is challenging.",
